# Security headers for every page and file Cloudflare serves from public/.
# upgrade-insecure-requests: the browser loads anything addressed with http:// over https:// instead,
# so a stray http:// link (for example in text or photos added later) can never make a page show "Not secure".
# Strict-Transport-Security: browsers always use https:// for this site, even when someone types http://.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
